Package: textscale
Title: Measure Latent Quantities from Text Using Pairwise Comparisons
Version: 0.0.0.9006
Authors@R: 
    person("Joseph T.", "Ornstein", , "jornstein@uga.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a method for measuring latent quantities (e.g.,
    ideology, ad tone, argument persuasiveness) from text by combining
    text embeddings with pairwise comparisons. Pairwise annotations —
    generated by human annotators or a large language model — identify a
    latent dimension in embedding space. An L2-regularized logistic
    regression model is then fit on embedding differences, enabling
    efficient scoring of new documents without additional pairwise
    annotations.
